                          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "xpqkI",
                          "name": "Para 2",
                          "fill": "$text-soft",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "2. What we provide. We give you access to Soleur so that your team and your agents can plan, write and carry out work for your business, as described on our pricing page.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "VG9H8",
                          "name": "Para 3",
                          "fill": "$text-soft",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "3. What you are responsible for. You decide what your agents are asked to do, and you check anything sent in your name before it leaves your business.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "o1ocv",
                          "name": "Para 4",
                          "fill": "$text-soft",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "4. Your data. You own what you put into Soleur. We use it only to run the service for you. You can export or delete it at any time.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "xlv6q",
                          "name": "Para 5",
                          "fill": "$text-soft",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "5. Paying and stopping. You pay the plan price each month. You can stop at any time; the plan then ends at the close of the month you have paid for.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "ObsQl",
                          "name": "Para 6",
                          "fill": "$text-soft",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "6. Changing these terms. If we change these terms we publish a new version and ask you again. A new version only applies once you have said Yes to it.",
