                          "name": "Para 3",
                          "fill": "$text-soft",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "3. What you are responsible for. You decide what your agents are asked to do, and you check anything sent in your name before it leaves your business.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "M5fnDm",
                          "name": "Para 4",
                          "fill": "$text-soft",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "4. Your data. You own what you put into Soleur. We use it only to run the service for you. You can export or delete it at any time.",
